    <p>Matricule : <span id="cert_Matricule"></span> | Corps: <span id="cert_Corps"></span></p>
    <p>CHAPITRE: <span id="cert_chapitre"></span></p>
    <p>Né(e) le <span id="cert_Datenaiss"></span> à <span id="cert_lieunaiss"></span></p>
    <p>Cin n° <span id="cert_Cin"></span> du <span id="cert_dateCin"></span> à <span id="cert_lieu"></span></p>
